hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2166","[AI-translation] Abu Burda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Allah ki hudood mein se hadd key siwa das kodon se zyada na maarna! (Bukhari: 6848)"
"2167","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne ghulaam par tohmat lagaaey jabke wo us se bari hai jise wo kahta hai, use Qiyaamat key din kodey lagaaey jaaengey magar ye ke wo waisa ho jaisa us ne kaha. (Bukhari: 6858). Diyyat ki kitaab."
